          ],
          "text": "According to Petitioner, petitioner asserts that the jury\u2019s unanimous not\u2011guilty announcement creates double\u2011jeopardy concerns."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "MR. SLOAN",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "b0064ce3217c0132951a54da0e8e2cb54f7b4ec44c9b3514aed39c3db06c3db4",
